[{"Directorate":"Finance, Planning and Performance","Description":"The Finance, Planning and Performance directorate is led by Sean Golding. This team covers:\n\n*   finance\n\n*   planning\n\n*   performance\n\n*   information security\n\n*   business assurance activity\n\n*   investment assurance\n\nTheir portfolio of work includes:\n\n*   overseeing our budgets and financial reporting\n\n*   governance, including strategy and business planning\n\n*   supplier assurance\n\n*   performance reporting\n\n*   risk management\n\n*   internal financial systems\n\n*   project portfolio prioritisation\n\n*   project assurance","Director":"Sean Golding","Director URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/9c3885815439c7c55a338efc","Total Headcount":52,"Roles":{"Management Accountant":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/e4dcbc9a5c888f3f6df7742e","Count":1},"Finance Executive":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/625ba4617bf95ae98d0e21c0","Count":6},"Assurance Manager":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/c60484981015cfdd571e2a38","Count":1},"Information Security Assurance Lead":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/671b1028d85859d3cba9e432","Count":1},"Executive Assistant":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/1bdd6d47af4cd1e4d1561038","Count":1},"Commercial Financial Analyst":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/3d88265614e8192307cbe695","Count":1},"Operational Finance Manager":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/64f2e69ff4d7a8d517943fd8","Count":2},"Financial Analyst":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/116b61162ffffd77ff1c7a11","Count":3},"Finance Analyst":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/967dba4aa9c73f04c2bc1529","Count":2},"Finance Business Partner or Finance Business Analyst":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/3e00e30773fb657f244f01bf","Count":2},"Risk Programme Manager":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/5b7474107576a41483b970b2","Count":1},"Business Manager":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/b6a1684a11975d292b5fbce7","Count":2},"Senior Commercial Policy Advisor":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/626677e4d6ee817c74594b44","Count":1},"Chief Accountant":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/58bed2bb5e2e0c051e166423","Count":1},"Technical Security Advisor":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/b6c3f3cf007ab0c9ac0a7b2b","Count":2},"Performance Management Assistant":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/1b5863048676c6345abce9bc","Count":1},"Senior Business Partner":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/d9ba04a958d10158cadb3113","Count":1},"Senior Finance Business Partner":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/3ab603bdb2f8ea35f614e4c4","Count":9},"Security Architect":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/45d8390c1b20255e26c07871","Count":2},"Finance Executive 2":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/480270c22d88475a2ac43fbf","Count":1},"Head of Function":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/eba1b5d4fb13ff6ddeb9778e","Count":9},"Systems Manager":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/7b64a3f0c6595031d745ca81","Count":1},"Data Protection Manager":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/63a6ab109fb2482ce1b9bcba","Count":1}}},{"Directorate":"Markets, Sourcing and Suppliers","Description":"Led by Clare Gibbs, the Markets, Sourcing and Suppliers \\(MSS\\) directorate supports central government departments, the wider public sector, and the supplier base. We aim to improve how outsourced services are assessed, managed, and delivered to ensure value for the nation.\n\n## **Core functions**\n\n## Policy and implementation\n\nDevelop commercial best practices and ensure their practical application across the commercial lifecycle.\n\n*   maintain the Sourcing, Construction, and Consultancy Playbooks\n\n*   provide “On the Shoulder Support” \\(OTSS\\) and training for complex practitioner challenges\n\n*   coordinate the Model Services Contract implementation\n\n## Supplier risk, resolution and response\n\nGather intelligence to monitor and mitigate supplier-related risks across the public sector.\n\n*   conduct market health assessments and investigations\n\n*   manage resolution planning to assess government risk exposure\n\n*   lead response efforts during strategic supplier financial distress\n\n## Debarment, estimating, finance and operations\n\nProtect public procurement and build financial capability through specialised oversight and support.\n\n*   operate the Debarment Review Service under the Procurement Act 2023\n\n*   provide expertise in commercial finance, financial analysis, and estimating, including “On the Shoulder Support” \\(OTSS\\) and training\n\n*   prioritisation and demand management\n\n*   drive strategy and business operations across the MSS directorate\n\n## Strategic supplier relationship management, commercial analysts and Crown Representative Programme\n\nStrengthen strategic supplier management capability across government.\n\n*   monitor trends with strategic supplier performance\n\n*   Crown Representatives manage risk and identify opportunities in strategic supplier engagements\n\n*   support improving SSRM maturity, including training and “On the Shoulder Support” \\(OTSS\\)\n\n## Strategic Partnering Programme \\(SPP\\)\n\nCoordinate integrated work with strategic suppliers and departments on service redesign and innovation across 3 pillars:\n\n1.  Digital: advice, insights and access to digital strategic suppliers.\n\n2.  Built Environment: infrastructure delivery and construction strategic supplier management.\n\n3.  Consultancy and Outsourced Services: managing management consultancy, facilities management and complex outsourcing.","Director":"Clare Gibbs","Director URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/c1d04b88e80e8655724dc369","Total Headcount":94,"Roles":{"Associate Commercial Specialist":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/92f5dc1accf3de712c2efc2c","Count":4},"Function Lead":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/f29ed35a21cf15466de36e8b","Count":6},"Deputy Director":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/e00bf50d8b68ba3ccea2040c","Count":14},"Senior Estimating Officer":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/818c67f677cf252c6d6c6d7d","Count":1},"Finance Analyst":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/967dba4aa9c73f04c2bc1529","Count":2},"Prioritisation and Demand Manager":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/46060be88e2caf0889f29098","Count":2},"Business Manager":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/b6a1684a11975d292b5fbce7","Count":1},"Senior Commercial Policy Advisor":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/626677e4d6ee817c74594b44","Count":4},"Model Services Contract Lead":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/609bffc967a9b1c6742429c3","Count":2},"Director":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/adc0e9d1d1c80f89676df58e","Count":2},"Strategic Partnering Manager":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/3ec1d712c834afd08a0e0cb8","Count":1},"Commercial Intelligence Analyst":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/7b967199a72c5f62b49d3921","Count":4},"Senior Commercial Analyst":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/2669339c4e1ea0bbf6b84328","Count":6},"Crown Representative":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/894424ea7f5fdcf3a052a60d","Count":23},"Head of Function":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/eba1b5d4fb13ff6ddeb9778e","Count":11},"Implementation Lead":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/c58203d0e07005fec0e019bd","Count":11}}},{"Directorate":"Complex Transactions Team","Description":"The Complex Transactions Team \\(CTT\\) is an internal team of senior commercial experts, tasked to resolve Government’s most critical commercial challenges. The team charge a day rate for their services, though seek only to recover the costs of these, which span the full commercial lifecycle:\n\n*   commercial strategy development\n\n*   complex delivery model and PFI support\n\n*   strategic procurement advice and support\n\n*   market engagement\n\n*   negotiation advice and support\n\n*   dispute resolution and avoidance\n\n*   contract exit support\n\n*   sharing commercial best practice and ‘big deal’ events for customers\n\n*   application of the Procurement Act\n\n*   commercial reviews of major programmes\n\n*   supporting policy design with strategic commercial support\n\nThey do this in 3 ways:\n\n1.  Oversight – through strategic input to transactions, including Board-level engagement and collaboration with other CO stakeholders through approval processes.\n\n2.  Advisory – consultancy to support departmental commercial functions and programmes, drawing on lessons from across Government and industry.\n\n3.  Delivery – to meet capability requirements, we can take temporary responsibility for delivering specific commercial functions on transactions, for example: leading negotiations or developing commercial strategy.","Director":"Brett Holtom","Director URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/8c419276151ccb2d9cba7555","Total Headcount":44,"Roles":{"Associate Commercial Specialist":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/92f5dc1accf3de712c2efc2c","Count":9},"Fast Streamer Complex Transactions Team":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/3060c9a91b991958377d1454","Count":2},"Crown Business Lead":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/735389b4ad5493b869f652a7","Count":2},"Commercial Lead":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/ed0224ae20cf0dee51d3e5ae","Count":2},"Deputy Director":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/e00bf50d8b68ba3ccea2040c","Count":26},"Business Manager":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/b6a1684a11975d292b5fbce7","Count":1},"Head of Function":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/eba1b5d4fb13ff6ddeb9778e","Count":2}}},{"Directorate":"Customer Experience","Description":"## Who we are\n\nThe Customer Experience Directorate is responsible for ensuring that:\n\n*   the voice of our customers is heard across Government Commercial Agency\n\n*   increasing spend through our agreements\n\n*   building and maintaining the reputation of the organisation\n\nThe directorate includes:\n\n*   Central Government Account Management\n\n*   Wider Public Sector Account Management\n\n*   CXD Hub\n\n*   Partnerships and Health Core\n\n## What we do\n\nWe support customers to use GCA commercial expertise, products and services in order to deliver substantial savings for taxpayers by leveraging the collective buying power of the entire public sector.\n\nWe manage the organisation’s relationship with our customers in the public and third sectors and ensure that what they say informs the work we as an organisation are doing. \n\nWe use the latest data and customer insight to inform our strategy to increase spend through GCA agreements and drive greater commercial benefits for our customers.","Director":"David Skinner","Director URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/ab2f8547812bffdbedc113cc","Total Headcount":81,"Roles":{"Executive Assistant":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/1bdd6d47af4cd1e4d1561038","Count":1},"Deputy Director":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/e00bf50d8b68ba3ccea2040c","Count":5},"Customer Operations lead":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/08f13f50d2f76b74ae353d11","Count":4},"Partnership Delivery Manager":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/ffb76288aa5924a4b3ef3d9d","Count":2},"Customer Operations Manager":{"URL":"https://