 GCA turn strategy into impact – realising{color} **value for the nation**{color:rgb(0, 0, 0)/}.{color}\n\n## CEO’s Office, Policy and Strategy\n\n*   supports the CEO day-to-day\n\n*   leads the design of our strategy,\n\n*   supports the successful implementation of commercial policy\n\n*   oversees our [governance](https://intranet.gca.gov.uk/about/our-governance/) framework\n\n## Marketing and Communications \\(Marcomms\\)\n\n*   activates and embeds the refreshed brand strategy: ‘value for the nation’\n\n*   improves user experience and reinforces our brand by improving the website\n\n*   proactively manages the reputation of GCA to position us for success\n\n*   effectively engage colleagues with our purpose, vision, and mission \\(internal communications\\)\n\n## Strategy\n\nDefines our:\n\n*   Target Operating Model – our future operating state\n\n*   how we will deliver the enterprise and functional strategies\n\n*   defining the required processes, functional workforce needs, information, data flows and technology landscape, to ensure our work with supplier and customers supports UK economic growth \n\n## Project Delivery / Portfolio Management\n\n*   delivers the right change in the right way by developing and maintaining an integrated change roadmap\n\n*   sequenced and aligned to strategy; establishing a structured approach \\(portfolio\\) to selecting projects and programmes that best support strategic objectives\n\n*   centralises and builds project delivery capability\n\n*   effective scrutiny and assurance of investment\n\n*   guided by the principles of simplicity, clarity, engagement and problem-solving, with a robust focus on outcomes","Director":"Claire Dartington","Director URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/208c5a37eb7f8e4235b450e8","Total Headcount":89,"Roles":{"Assurance Manager":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/component-overview/c60484981015cfdd571e2a38","Count":1},"Marketing Officer":{"URL":"https://gca.ardoq.com/app/comp